Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Envelope Slit with a Rusting Scalpel
- Story & Context: In the projection booth of the crumbling Odeon Cinema, Arthur intercepted a tax demand postmarked six months prior, realizing the theater was scheduled for demolition at dawn. Enraged by the news, he locked the doors, spliced a blank reel onto the spindle, and turned the projector's carbon arc lamp to maximum heat. As the smell of melting celluloid filled the room, Devlin grabbed a microphone to vent his rage over a brutal 138-BPM breakbeat driven by machine-gun claps and screaming Hammond organ stabs. "They wrote the notice in red ink but the ink faded before it reached my hand," echoed through the dark auditorium, marking the accidental birth of Nitrate-Shudder.
